Thank you so much for showing the differences!

I'd REALLY LIKE PEOPLE'S OPINIONS HERE.

I prefer cloth bound without dust jacket, for the simple reason that
we don't have the resources to do a really pretty full color cover
and it's not that sort of book anyway, but what do other people
think?

